## 1. EXECUTIVE SYSTEM SUMMARY

The **GMIU CE & IT Department Portal** is an enterprise-grade academic management web application engineered for the Department of **Information Technology (IT)** and **Computer Engineering (CE)** at **Gyanmanjari Innovative University (GMIU)**.

### Core Objectives:
1. **Academic Accountability**: Record and audit daily faculty classroom lectures, practical lab sessions, syllabus completion, student attendance counts, and Continuous Teaching & Learning (CTL) activities.
2. **Instant Incident Escalation**: Enable real-time logging and immediate administrator notification when zero students attend a scheduled class (`zero-student-report.php`).
3. **Automated Live Timetable Distribution**: Stream dynamic faculty and student timetables with one-click background synchronization directly from cloud Google Sheets to local high-speed JSON/JS matrix caches.
4. **Hybrid Serverless Cloud Storage**: Combine the speed of local Apache/PHP web hosting with the collaborative power and zero-maintenance database features of **Google Sheets** and **Google Drive** using Google Apps Script Web Apps.
5. **Secure Transactional Communications**: Enforce 6-digit email OTP verification before submitting sensitive departmental reports, dispatching branded HTML summary emails via Gmail SMTP.

