## 5. HOW ALL MODULES ARE CONNECTED (END-TO-END DATA FLOWS)

```
========================================================================================
5.1. FACULTY DAILY WORKLOAD SUBMISSION LIFECYCLE
========================================================================================

 [Faculty Member]
        |
        | 1. Fills form (Faculty name, lecture details, attendance, topics)
        v
  [report.php]
        |
        | 2. Autosaves inputs continuously in browser LocalStorage
        | 3. User clicks "Submit Report"
        v
  [otp-verify.js]  <------ Checks config.php (otp_enabled == 1?)
        |
        +-----> POST otp-service.php?action=send_otp
        |              |
        |              | 4. Generates 6-digit cryptographic code
        |              | 5. Sends email via Gmail SMTP (send_otp_smtp_mail)
        |              v
        |       [Faculty Email Inbox (@gmiu.edu.in)]
        |              |
        |              | 5b. Faculty enters 6-digit code in modal
        v              v
  [otp-verify.js] ----> POST otp-service.php?action=verify_otp
        |
        | 6. Code verified successfully (verified == true)
        v
  [report.php Form Dispatcher]
        |
        +====================================+====================================+
        |                                                                         |
        v HTTP POST JSON                                                          v HTTP POST JSON
  [proxy-sheets.php?target=report]                                         [send-email.php]
        |                                                                         |
        | 7. Reads sheets_webapp_url from config.php                              | 8. Verifies recipient domain
        | 8. Executes cURL to Google Script Web App                               | 9. Connects to Gmail SMTP:465
        v                                                                         v
  [Google Apps Script (Code.gs)]                                           [GMIU Mail Servers]
        |                                                                         |
        | 9. Appends new row into "2026-27 ODD"                                   | 10. Delivers HTML report to
        v                                                                         |     Department HOD & Admin
  [Google Sheets Master Database]                                                 v
                                                                           [Admin Inbox (@gmiu.edu.in)]
```

```
========================================================================================
5.2. ZERO-STUDENT ATTENDANCE INCIDENT REPORTING LIFECYCLE
========================================================================================

 [Faculty Member] (Class is empty at scheduled lecture time)
        |
        v
  [zero-student-report.php]
        |
        | 1. Selects Room, Subject, Faculty, Time Slot & Reason
        | 2. Submits Incident Alert
        v
  [zero-student-report.js]
        |
        v HTTP POST JSON
  [proxy-sheets.php?target=zero]
        |
        | 3. Security Guard: Verifies same-origin or authenticated session
        | 4. Deduplication Check:
        |    - Generates MD5 hash: md5(Date|Room|Subject|Faculty|TimeIn|TimeOut)
        |    - Checks session & uploads/.zs_dedup_cache.json
        |    - Rejects if submitted < 120 seconds ago (HTTP 429 Duplicate)
        | 5. cURL dispatches to zero_sheets_webapp_url
        v
  [Google Apps Script (google-apps-script-zero.js)]
        |
        +-----------------------------------+------------------------------------+
        |                                                                        |
        v                                                                        v
  [Google Sheets: "Zero Student Log"]                                     [Emergency Email Notification]
  - Appends record with timestamp                                         - Instant alert sent to HOD
  - Marks status as "PENDING REVIEW"                                      - Includes Room No. & Faculty name
```

```
