 (A) Automated Polling (Every 300s)                                (B) Manual 1-Click Sync
  [timetableSync.js in browser]                                     Admin clicks "Sync Now"
        |                                                                        |
        v                                                                        v
  [sync-timetables.php?action=check]                                [timetableSync.js Modal]
