        +-----------------------------------+------------------------------------+
                                            |
                                            v
                                 [sync-timetables.php]
                                            |
                                            | 1. Fetches Excel from Apps Script Web App
                                            | 2. Validates PK\x03\x04 binary zip header
                                            | 3. Checks MD5 hash against existing file
                                            v
                                [Has file changed?]
                                   /           \
                           YES    /             \   NO
                                 v               v
                [Save binary to uploads/]     [Return JSON: "Already up-to-date"]
                         |
                         +-----------------------------+
                         |                             |
                         v                             v
           (For Faculty Timetable)          (For Student Timetable)
          [timetable-compiler.php]         [student-timetable-parser.php]
                         |                             |
          - Unzips Excel in scratch/       - Unzips Excel in scratch/
