                                        v
                 [Browser auto-refreshes views with fresh data]
```

```
========================================================================================
5.4. SESSION SECURITY & AUTHENTICATION LIFECYCLE
========================================================================================

 [User Accesses Protected Route] (e.g. ctlactivity.php, ctldrive.php, sync-timetables)
        |
        v
  [auth-check.php]
        |
        | 1. Checks config.php (password_required == 1?)
        | 2. Checks $_SESSION['authenticated'] === true?
        |
        +-----> YES: Grants access to target page
        |
        +-----> NO: Halts execution, sets HTTP security headers,
                    and renders [auth-login-page.php]
                           |
                           | 3. User enters master password
                           v
                    [auth-login-page.php JS]
                           |
                           v POST JSON { password: "..." }
                    [verify-password.php]
                           |
                           | 4. Reads correct_password hash from config.php
                           | 5. password_verify($password, $correct_password)
                           |
                           +-----> SUCCESS: Sets $_SESSION['authenticated'] = true
                           |                Returns { success: true }
                           |                Page automatically reloads and unlocks
                           |
                           +-----> FAILURE: Returns HTTP 401 Unauthorized
                                            Displays "Invalid Password" error shake
```

```
========================================================================================
5.5. HEADLESS SYLLABUS & EXAM PAPERS SCRAPING LIFECYCLE
========================================================================================

 [Student / Faculty] enters Subject Code or Subject Name
        |
        v
  [syllabus-papers.php]
        |
        v GET JSON /scrape.php?url=https://gmiu.edu.in/exam-portal/...
  [scrape.php]
        |
        | 1. Validates URL integrity and scheme
        | 2. Initializes cURL with modern browser headers & user agent
        | 3. Bypasses CORS restrictions on external server
        | 4. Retrieves HTML document from university examination repository
        | 5. Extracts exam paper PDF download links and syllabus tables
        v
  [JSON Response returned to syllabus-papers.php]
        |
        v
  [Frontend renders interactive subject cards & direct PDF download links]
```

