## 6. MASTER CONFIGURATION MATRIX (`config.php`)

All environmental, credential, and feature toggles are centralized in `config.php`:

| Configuration Key | Data Type | Default Value | Security Role & Impact |
| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
| `smtp_email` | `string` | `adminit@gmiu.edu.in` | IT Department Gmail SMTP sender email address |
| `smtp_password` | `string` | *(16-char App Password)* | IT Department Google App Password (2FA bypass) |
| `smtp_email_ce` | `string` | `admincecse@gmiu.edu.in` | CE Department Gmail SMTP sender email address |
| `smtp_password_ce` | `string` | *(16-char App Password)* | CE Department Google App Password (2FA bypass) |
| `mail_enabled` | `int (0/1)` | `1` | Global email toggle. Set to `0` for offline testing |
| `zero_mail_enabled` | `int (0/1)` | `1` | Toggles email alerts specifically for Zero Student reports |
| `otp_enabled` | `int (0/1)` | `1` | Enforces 6-digit OTP verification for report submissions |
| `ctl_excel_server_error`| `int (0/1)` | `0` | Debug switch: `1` simulates server error after Excel upload |
| `sheets_webapp_url` | `string` | *(Google Script URL)* | Endpoint for appending Faculty Daily Workload records |
| `zero_sheets_webapp_url`| `string` | *(Google Script URL)* | Endpoint for appending Zero Student Incident records |
| `mail_tracking_webapp_url`| `string` | *(Google Script URL)* | Endpoint for audit logging all outgoing SMTP emails |
| `student_timetable_webapp_url` | `string` | *(Google Script URL)* | Endpoint providing Student Timetable Excel stream |
| `faculty_timetable_webapp_url` | `string` | *(Google Script URL)* | Endpoint providing Faculty Timetable Excel stream |
| `auto_sync_enabled` | `int (0/1)` | `1` | Enables background periodic timetable sync |
| `auto_sync_interval`| `int` | `300` | Auto-sync polling interval in seconds (5 minutes) |
| `password_required` | `int (0/1)` | `1` | Master portal password lock for protected dashboards |
| `correct_password` | `string` | *(Bcrypt Hash)* | Bcrypt hash (`$2y$10$...`) for master portal unlock |

